('9400', NULL, '9300', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '192', '0', '1', '9305', '9305', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'card_group', 'Current Topics', '', NULL, '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, '<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\" standalone=\"yes\" ?>\n<T3FlexForms>\n    <data>\n        <sheet index=\"sDEF\">\n            <language index=\"lDEF\">\n                <field index=\"align\">\n                    <value index=\"vDEF\">left</value>\n                </field>\n                <field index=\"columns\">\n                    <value index=\"vDEF\">3</value>\n                </field>\n            </language>\n        </sheet>\n    </data>\n</T3FlexForms>', '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '3', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9401', NULL, '9300', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '96', '0', '1', '9306', '9306', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'textteaser', 'Town between water, forest and change', '', '<p>The historic town centre around Alter Markt, green banks along the Falkenbach and a strong SME sector shape the image of the town. In eight districts live families, students and people who have called this place home for generations.</p>\r\n<p>The town is committed to an administration that works simply and clearly. You can already deal with many matters online. In addition, there are projects for sustainable mobility, climate protection and a vibrant town centre.</p>\r\n<p>You can read more about history, districts and sights in the <a href=\"t3://page?uid=9310\">Town portrait</a>.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Falkenquell is a medium-sized town with around 58,400 inhabitants. The Falkenbach and the springs at Falkenwald gave the town its name.', '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9402', NULL, '9300', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '40', '0', '1', '9307', '9307', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'icon_group', 'Done quickly', '', NULL, '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '6', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9403', NULL, '9302', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '512', '0', '1', '9308', '9308', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'accordion', 'Frequently Asked Questions', '', NULL, '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '4', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9404', NULL, '9302', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '192', '0', '1', '9309', '9309', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'texticon', 'Book an appointment online', '', '<p>Select your request and an available appointment online. You will receive confirmation by email. You can cancel the appointment free of charge up to the day before.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', 'EXT:bootstrap_package/Resources/Public/Images/Icons/Ionicons/calendar.svg', 'EXT:bootstrap_package/Resources/Public/Images/Icons/Ionicons/', '0', 'left', 'default', 'circle', '#FFFFFF', '#094277', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9405', NULL, '9302', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '64', '0', '1', '9310', '9310', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'panel', 'Current Notice', '', '<p>Due to construction work, the main entrance of the Town Hall is closed until 18 December. Please use the entrance on Marktstraße.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'primary', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9406', NULL, '9302', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '24', '0', '1', '9311', '9311', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'textteaser', 'Citizens\' Office', '', '<p>The Citizens\' Office is located on the ground floor of the Town Hall on the market square. For most matters, you will need an appointment. This helps you avoid waiting times.</p>\r\n<p>You can make appointments online, by telephone or directly on site. Please bring valid identification with you to every appointment.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '1', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'At the Citizens\' Office, you can take care of the most common matters in one place: from identity cards to registering your residence.', '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9407', NULL, '9303', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '512', '0', '1', '9312', '9312', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'panel', 'Good to know', '', '<p>You do not need an appointment to collect an identity card or passport that has already been applied for.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'success', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
