('9425', NULL, '9308', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '96', '0', '1', '9330', '9330', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'texticon', 'More space for cycling', '', '<p>Falkenquell is gradually expanding its cycle path network. New links are intended to connect residential neighbourhoods more effectively with the town centre, railway station and schools.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', 'EXT:bootstrap_package/Resources/Public/Images/Icons/Ionicons/map.svg', 'EXT:bootstrap_package/Resources/Public/Images/Icons/Ionicons/', '0', 'left', 'default', 'circle', '#FFFFFF', '#094277', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9426', NULL, '9308', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '48', '0', '1', '9331', '9331', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'icon_group', 'Out and about in Falkenquell', '', NULL, '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '4', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9427', NULL, '9308', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '24', '0', '1', '9332', '9332', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'textteaser', 'Mobility', '', '<p>The Falkenquell Mobility Concept 2035 sets out how transport in the town is to develop. The aim is safe cycle paths, frequent bus services and less traffic in the town centre.</p>\r\n<p>Residents helped shape the concept in several workshops. You can find the current status under <a href=\"t3://page?uid=9318\">Public Participation</a>.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '1', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Bus, train, bicycle or car: in Falkenquell you can reach your destination in many ways. With the Mobility Concept 2035, the town is planning the next steps.', '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9428', NULL, '9310', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '384', '0', '1', '9333', '9333', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'card_group', 'Sights', '', NULL, '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, '<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\" standalone=\"yes\" ?>\n<T3FlexForms>\n    <data>\n        <sheet index=\"sDEF\">\n            <language index=\"lDEF\">\n                <field index=\"align\">\n                    <value index=\"vDEF\">left</value>\n                </field>\n                <field index=\"columns\">\n                    <value index=\"vDEF\">3</value>\n                </field>\n            </language>\n        </sheet>\n    </data>\n</T3FlexForms>', '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '6', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9429', NULL, '9310', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '192', '0', '1', '9334', '9334', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'accordion', 'The Districts', '', NULL, '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '8', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9430', NULL, '9310', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '96', '0', '1', '9335', '9335', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'textpic', 'Life on the Falkenbach', '', '<p>The Falkenbach shapes the townscape of Falkenquell. Along the riverbank, green spaces, paths and small squares connect the town centre with the neighbouring districts.</p>\r\n<p>In recent years, several sections of the riverbank have been redesigned. New seating, additional trees and the upgraded cycle path make the Falkenbach an important recreational and connecting space.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '1', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9431', NULL, '9310', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '48', '0', '1', '9336', '9336', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'icon_group', 'Figures & Facts', '', NULL, '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '4', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9432', NULL, '9310', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '24', '0', '1', '9337', '9337', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'textteaser', 'Town Portrait', '', '<p>Springs and mills on the Falkenbach brought the town work and prosperity over the centuries. In the 19th century, Falkenquell became a regional centre for crafts and mechanical engineering. The Town Hall on the market square also dates from this period.</p>\r\n<p>Today, the town combines historic buildings with new residential neighbourhoods and commercial areas. The Falkenbach is once again a place for walking, cycling and relaxing.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '1', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Falkenquell lies on an old trade route between Falkenbach and Falkenwald. The town was first mentioned in the early 13th century.', '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9433', NULL, '9311', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '512', '0', '1', '9338', '9338', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'textteaser', 'Shaping the town centre together', '', '<p>As part of the town centre development, the town is planning a new market square with trees, seating and water features. Parking spaces are to be moved to the nearby multi-storey car parks.</p>\r\n<p>You can submit suggestions and join the discussion on the designs until the end of January. You can find all information under <a href=\"t3://page?uid=9318\">Public Participation</a>.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'The market square is to become greener and easier for everyone to use. Your ideas will be incorporated into the planning.', '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9434', NULL, '9311', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '192', '0', '1', '9339', '9339', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'panel', 'Funding for Homeowners', '', '<p>The town supports roof and façade greening with up to 50 per cent of the costs. You can submit applications throughout the year.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'success', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9435', NULL, '9311', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '96', '0', '1', '9340', '9340', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'card_group', 'Current Projects', '', NULL, '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, '<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\" standalone=\"yes\" ?>\n<T3FlexForms>\n    <data>\n        <sheet index=\"sDEF\">\n            <language index=\"lDEF\">\n                <field index=\"align\">\n                    <value index=\"vDEF\">left</value>\n                </field>\n                <field index=\"columns\">\n                    <value index=\"vDEF\">3</value>\n                </field>\n            </language>\n        </sheet>\n    </data>\n</T3FlexForms>', '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '3', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9436', NULL, '9311', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '48', '0', '1', '9341', '9341', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'icon_group', 'Our priorities', '', NULL, '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '3', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9437', NULL, '9311', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '24', '0', '1', '9342', '9342', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'textpic', 'Climate Protection & Urban Development', '', '<p>Falkenquell aims to become climate-neutral by 2040. To this end, the Town Council has adopted a municipal climate protection programme.</p>\r\n<p>The town is refurbishing its own buildings, installing solar systems and creating more green spaces in the town centre. Many measures can only succeed through joint efforts with residents and businesses.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '1', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '1', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9438', NULL, '9312', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '512', '0', '1', '9343', '9343', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'texticon', 'Your contact for Economic Development', '', '<p>Economic Development Falkenquell<br />Town Hall, Marktplatz 1<br />Telephone: 0 54 21 / 30 00-400<br />Email: <a href=\"mailto:wirtschaft@falkenquell.example\">wirtschaft@falkenquell.example</a></p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', 'EXT:bootstrap_package/Resources/Public/Images/Icons/Ionicons/briefcase.svg', 'EXT:bootstrap_package/Resources/Public/Images/Icons/Ionicons/', '0', 'left', 'default', 'circle', '#FFFFFF', '#094277', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9439', NULL, '9312', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '160', '0', '1', '9344', '9344', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'card_group', 'Spaces and Services', '', NULL, '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, '<?xml version=\"1.0\" encoding=\"utf-8\" standalone=\"yes\" ?>\n<T3FlexForms>\n    <data>\n        <sheet index=\"sDEF\">\n            <language index=\"lDEF\">\n                <field index=\"align\">\n                    <value index=\"vDEF\">left</value>\n                </field>\n                <field index=\"columns\">\n                    <value index=\"vDEF\">3</value>\n                </field>\n            </language>\n        </sheet>\n    </data>\n</T3FlexForms>', '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '3', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9440', NULL, '9312', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '96', '0', '1', '9345', '9345', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'icon_group', 'Good reasons for Falkenquell', '', NULL, '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '3', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '3', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9441', NULL, '9312', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '48', '0', '1', '9346', '9346', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'textteaser', 'Business location', '', '<p>More than 2,300 companies are based in Falkenquell. Many of them are family-run and have been rooted in the region for decades.</p>\r\n<p>Economic development assists with the search for sites, with permits and with funding applications. There is dedicated advice for start-ups.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '1', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'Falkenquell is a location with a strong SME sector. Mechanical engineering, IT, environmental technology and the health economy shape the town’s economy.', '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9442', NULL, '9314', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '384', '0', '1', '9347', '9347', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'textpic', 'News', '', '<p>Latest news from the Town Hall and the town community.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '1', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9443', NULL, '9315', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '384', '0', '1', '9348', '9348', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'textpic', 'Events', '', '<p>Concerts, markets, guided tours and Town Council meetings: here you will find all dates in Falkenquell.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '1', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9444', NULL, '9316', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '512', '0', '1', '9349', '9349', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'panel', 'Official Gazette by email', '', '<p>Don’t want to miss an issue? Write to <a href=\"mailto:amtsblatt@falkenquell.example\">amtsblatt@falkenquell.example</a>. We will send you each new issue.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '0', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'primary', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
('9445', NULL, '9316', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '', '160', '0', '1', '9350', '9350', NULL, '', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'textpic', 'Official Gazette', '', '<p>In the Official Gazette, the town of Falkenquell publishes official notices, by-laws and resolutions of the Town Council. It is published once a month.</p>', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '0', '1', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '0', '', '', '', '', '0', '', '', '0', '1', '1', '0', '', '0', '', '', '', '0', '0', NULL, NULL, '', '', NULL, '124', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', NULL, '1.3333333333333', '10', '', '', '', 'default', '', '', '', '0', '', 'default', 'default', '#FFFFFF', '#333333', '', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', '0', 'default', '', '0', NULL, '0', '', '', '', '2', '', '', '', NULL, '', '0', '', '0', NULL, NULL, NULL, '0'),
