('9397', '9334', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '1', '1', '9346', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '92', NULL, '9478', 'Mineral water', '', '1', '<p>Still, medium and classic: The mineral water is bottled almost entirely in returnable glass bottles. The bottling plant can handle up to 40,000 bottles per hour.</p>', '', '', '', '', '0', 'outline-primary'),
('9398', '9334', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '2', '1', '9347', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '93', NULL, '9478', 'Beer', '', '1', '<p>A lager, a pilsner and seasonal specialties are produced in the brewhouse on Brunnenweg. Brewing is done using water from our own wells and malt from the region.</p>', '', '', '', '', '0', 'outline-primary'),
('9399', '9334', '1793957032', '1793957032', '0', '0', '0', '0', '3', '1', '9348', '', '0', '0', '0', '0', '94', NULL, '9478', 'Training', '', '1', '<p>Every year, around ten young people begin their training, for example in brewing, food technology or warehouse logistics.</p>', '', '', '', '', '0', 'outline-primary');
